====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To fall apart into shards, usually as the result of impact or explosion.
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To break (something) into shards.
# {{lb|en|online gaming|transitive}} To divide (an [[MMORPG]]) into several [[#Noun|shards]], or to establish a shard of one.

